        "Title": "The way to the bathroom",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN",
        "PublicId": "103786857103",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 719b7083-58ed-498a-b5ab-824985d9ac5e).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\r\rOur client is Claudia Di Meo, the servant at Caruso Villa. \rMany times she witnessed how the scientist of the undermansion lab goes up to the wine cellar, drinks wine in the company of the gardener and relieves himself directly on the wall near the place where these two are hanging out. The dialogue led nowhere and Claudia wants us to show signore Endrizzi the way to the bathroom situated at the same floor... for the very last time. \r\rPrepare yourself for the mission.",
